# US-29 AC-29.2.2.2: generated presigned R2 URL map — live, short-TTL SigV4
# signatures with no evidentiary value once their TTL expires; committing one
# is unnecessary exposure of a time-boxed R2 credential fragment. Regenerated
# by scripts/benchmark/presign-r2-urls.sh. .gitkeep keeps the directory itself
# tracked so the docker-compose.yml bind-mount has somewhere to land.
scripts/benchmark/presign-data/*.json
